unitree_sdk2_hzj
================

HZJ rewrite of the Unitree SDK2 DDS integration path.

Upstream snapshot
-----------------
Original ChannelFactory, dds_wrapper, IDL headers, CMake imported-library
layout, prebuilt `libunitree_sdk2.a`, and bundled CycloneDDS 0.10.2 binaries
were copied from:

  https://github.com/topsun-bot/unitree_sdk2
  commit 9754cd153af3da471b0fe5f3aa535e426fb11db3
  (fork of unitreerobotics/unitree_sdk2; 70 commits ahead of tag 2.0.2)

That tree remains the tracking fork. This repository is an independent
topsun-bot product — it is not a PR into topsun_dimos and does not overwrite
topsun-bot/unitree_sdk2.

Companion
---------
https://github.com/topsun-bot/ros2_hzj v0.1.0 @ 218903b vendors CycloneDDS
11.0.1. That is not a drop-in replacement for the 0.10.2 `.so` files here.

